WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.473
Your supplier sells out of a variant.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.643
But your eBay listing still shows it in stock.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.120
So you check supplier pages by hand, one listing at a time.

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.946
Miss one, and you oversell.

5
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.947
ELM keeps your eBay listings in step with your Shopify-powered suppliers, down to the variant.

6
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:23.987
Today, it checks every supplier variant: in stock, out of stock, or unknown.

7
00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:27.689
When one sells out, the matching eBay quantity goes to zero.

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.320
If a check fails, ELM holds the last known quantity instead of zeroing it.

9
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.160
And a second check confirms a restock before stock goes back up.

10
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.153
Dry run shows you every change before anything is sent to eBay.

11
00:00:40.233 --> 00:00:42.847
And every change has a recorded reason.

12
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:47.454
Coming at launch: discover a supplier's catalog and pick products.

13
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:51.436
ELM will generate SKUs and prepare your eBay listings.

14
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.887
Smart mapping will match by SKU, options, and title.

15
00:00:54.967 --> 00:00:57.045
Uncertain matches go to your review.

16
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:04.050
ELM Easy Monitoring. Early access is coming soon. Follow ELM to get the waitlist link first.
